message: "If you use chooong.datasift in your work, please cite this software."
type: software
title: chooong.datasift
authors:
  - family-names: Steinbach
    given-names: Marcus
repository-code: https://github.com/chooong-group/chooong.datasift
url: https://github.com/chooong-group/chooong.datasift
abstract: >-
  chooong.datasift is a Python library with a Rust engine for discovering,
  validating, filtering and streaming tabular data from XLSX, XLSM and CSV
  files. It supports JSON-defined filters, column selection, type conversion,
  required fields, and NDJSON and Parquet export.
keywords:
  - python
  - rust
  - xlsx
  - csv
  - streaming
  - filtering
  - data-validation
  - parquet
license: Apache-2.0
